{"id":"b24f5ca449","t":"How To Live As An Unlicensed Healer","c":"cv","n":148,"l":149,"s":["ml","mg"],"k":{"ml":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer","mg":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer"},"u":1795768219887,"desc":"يومًا ما، فتح كانج سونغ هيون عينيه في قارة أزول، ولم يكن يعرف السبب وراء ذلك، وعندما استيقظ، لم يعد في كوريا الجنوبية، بل ألقي به في عالم خيالي. “لماذا وصلت إلى هذا النوع من العالم؟” في ذلك الوقت، يظهر نافذة الحالة أمامه ” مهنتك معالج” لكن بدون علاج. وكان ذلك بداية حياة علاجية غير مرخصة، عالم المعالج الذي لا يعرف كيفية الشفاء. كانج سونغ هيون جيد في كل شيء باستثناء الشفاء، في عالم الخيال كمعالج غير مرخص، تبدأ قصة بقاءه.","type":"Manhwa","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اعادة احياء","اكشن","خارق للطبيعه","خيال","دموى","سحر","غموض"],"src":{"ml":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer","mg":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|/manga/how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer/1/","mg":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|"},"2":{"ml":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|/manga/how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer/2/","mg":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|"},"3":{"ml":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|/manga/how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer/3/","mg":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|"},"4":{"ml":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|/manga/how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer/4/","mg":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|"},"5":{"ml":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|/manga/how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer/5/","mg":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|"},"6":{"ml":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|/manga/how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer/6/","mg":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|"},"7":{"ml":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|/manga/how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer/7/","mg":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|"},"8":{"ml":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|/manga/how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer/8/","mg":"how-to-live-as-an-unlicensed-healer|"},"9":{"ml":"how-to-liv